{
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Praxis with a degree-twelve base and a binomial extension",
  "claims": [
    "params.json is a parameter set of Praxis for the reference statement at 100-bit security whose ciphertext is 6721 MiB (6.5634 GiB) and whose time, one encryption plus one expected decryption, is 2841349 million field multiplications (20777 and 2820572), by the protected model, and every rule of the model as amended holds for it; proof.md proves that each amended entry (I3, Ncmp, I6, I4, n2, dec_msm_g1, dec_msm_g2, dec_pairings, n1, C6, C7, dec_sum_g2, H2) is sound, so that the paper's theorems hold for these parameters as rules.md requires."
  ],
  "experiments": [],
